WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Docracy — close deals in minutes. AI auto-detect places every field.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.500
Step 1: Choose a sample document or upload your PDF — templates included.

00:11.500 --> 00:19.000
Step 2: Add signers in order — sequential or all-at-once signing.

00:19.000 --> 00:30.000
Step 3: AI auto-detect finds signature and date fields, plus a plain-English summary.

00:30.000 --> 00:39.000
Step 4: Send for signature — signers get an email link, no account needed.

00:39.000 --> 00:48.500
Step 5: Each signer reviews the PDF and signs — draw or type.

00:48.500 --> 00:57.500
Step 6: When everyone signs, download the final PDF and certificate of completion.

00:57.500 --> 01:03.000
Upload. Auto-detect. Send. Sign. Done — at docracy.io.
